The Programme Committee has completed the first round, selecting about
56 people for invitation to the kernel summit; the invitation emails
will be going out over the next few days.  We should be holding the next
round selection mid next week, with the aim of having the second round
of invitations sent out by the end of that week (by 16 July).

We should also be selecting the day 2 mini summits by that same date (16
July).

Once the invitation emails have been sent out, we'll publish the
invitation list, so you can begin planning topics and hallway
conversations.

James


